    "reading_order": 3,
    "text": "In the examples above, we observe some patterns. In some, we find that the\nsucceeding terms are obtained by adding a fixed number, in other by multiplying\nwith a fixed number, in another we find that they are squares of consecutive\nnumbers, and so on.",
    "latex": null,
