      203.51
    ],
    "reading_order": 4,
    "text": "In this chapter, we shall discuss one of these patterns in which succeeding terms\nare obtained by adding a fixed number to the preceding terms. We shall also see how\nto find their nth terms and the sum of n consecutive terms, and use this knowledge in\nsolving some daily life problems.",
    "latex": null,
